              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yīgiye imbere yaho, abona abavukana bandi babiri, Yakobo mwene Zebedayo, na mwene nyina Yohana, bari kumwe na se Zebedayo mu bgato, bariko barasana insenga zabo, arabahamagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
